(7734654, 1274878, 29535, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this is a little soft, as the subject is a good find and I think this could have been made to work with some minor adjustments. Revisit this!</td>', 'Unfortunately this is a little soft, as the subject is a good find and I think this could have been made to work with some minor adjustments. Revisit this!', '2022-12-15 12:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734655, 1274866, 29535, '<td valign="top">You nailed the challenge topic, well done. I would love to see this a little wider, without cropping the wreath and I think this would improve it a lot :)</td>', 'You nailed the challenge topic, well done. I would love to see this a little wider, without cropping the wreath and I think this would improve it a lot :)', '2022-12-15 12:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734746, 1274868, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is the standout from the contest. With a challenge like this I''d rather see a simple subject shot perfectly in the style of the challenge than too much overthinking going into it. Possibly because I know that I go through the same stressing-out-about-my-subject process, when in reality something simple and recognisable shot with perfect lighting in the requested style has produced the most pleasing image.<br/> <br/>We can all learn from your choices here!</td>', 'This is the standout from the contest. With a challenge like this I''d rather see a simple subject shot perfectly in the style of the challenge than too much overthinking going into it. Possibly because I know that I go through the same stressing-out-about-my-subject process, when in reality something simple and recognisable shot with perfect lighting in the requested style has produced the most pleasing image. We can all learn from your choices here!', '2022-12-16 11:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734748, 1274681, 29535, '<td valign="top">One of my top 2! Perfectly respects the challenge parameters, and you''ve done well to choose a couple of items you presumably had to hand, but that you knew had enough character, colour and beauty in themselves to be able to produce a wonderful shot.<br/> <br/>Combined with the great choice of texture with the background, it has all the makings of a winner. Good luck! This is how to approach a challenge like this, I''d love to take a leaf out of your book next time this kind of shoot presents itself (I''m sorry if that pun sounded forced it was literally the only way to express what I needed here &amp;#128517;)</td>', 'One of my top 2! Perfectly respects the challenge parameters, and you''ve done well to choose a couple of items you presumably had to hand, but that you knew had enough character, colour and beauty in themselves to be able to produce a wonderful shot. Combined with the great choice of texture with the background, it has all the makings of a winner. Good luck! This is how to approach a challenge like this, I''d love to take a leaf out of your book next time this kind of shoot presents itself (I''m sorry if that pun sounded forced it was literally the only way to express what I needed here &#128517;)', '2022-12-16 11:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
